OL,3,GNEWSAFunding bid aims to modernise     
OL,4,Acity's theatre                         
OL,6,FOne of Peterborough's oldest theatre   
OL,7,Fbuildings could benefit from a #2.3m   
OL,8,Fupgrade if a funding bid is successful.
OL,10,FOperator Landmark Theatres has         
OL,11,Fsubmitted two planning applications to 
OL,12,FPeterborough City Council for The New  
OL,13,FTheatre on Broadway to upgrade its     
OL,14,Fageing infrastructure.                 
OL,16,FThe organisation is seeking #2.14m in  
OL,17,Ffunding from Arts Council England's    
OL,18,FCreative Foundation Fund towards the   
OL,19,Foverall costs for the project.         
