OL,3,GNEWSAFunding bid aims to modernise     
OL,4,Acity's theatre                         
OL,6,FIf funding is agreed, refurbishment    
OL,7,Fwork could begin in April 2027 and     
OL,8,Fcontinue until March 2030, subject to  
OL,9,Fplanning approval.                     
